":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.6.dev.custom_build [63e14e13f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (63e14e13f) - macOS Sequoia (15.7.2) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the mouse cursor is locked by a project using\n```gdscript\nInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n```\nwhen the project is closed from the editor using the shortcut (Cmd + Period on macOS), the cursor remains locked and the editor becomes unusable.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8acfbaf5-7003-45d0-8c4f-12e4f5539fe9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project. In the project, add a simple script like this:\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready():\n    Input.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n```\n\nUnder the Game tab's Embedding options:\n- Check \"Embed Game on Next Play\"\n- Uncheck \"Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play\"\n\nRun the scene. The mouse cursor should disappear as it is captured.\n\nStop the project, such as by using the keyboard shortcut (Cmd + Period on macOS). The game view will disappear as if the project is stopped, but the mouse will not reappear, and click events will remain at the same point on the screen.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe attached project should be set up and ready to run: \n\n[test-mouse-lock_2025-12-04_12-43-49.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23943419/test-mouse-lock_2025-12-04_12-43-49.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113589/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113589/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}